(ASHGROVE POINT REEFER YARD) Tj T*
(dispatch operations memorandum) Tj T*
(operating day AP-2044-D111      day reference DSP-067712) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1  RECONCILIATION PASSES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(   The load reconciliation is worked as a bounded sequence of passes.) Tj T*
(   The pass budget for this operating day is 5 passes.) Tj T*
(   The budget is spent whether or not the shares have settled. A pass) Tj T*
(   that would move a share by less than the minimum step moves it by) Tj T*
(   the minimum step instead.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(   pass budget                  5) Tj T*
(   minimum step watt hours      400) Tj T*
(   dependency protection depth  2) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2  DEADLINE SURCHARGE LADDER) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(   A reefer that leaves its mandatory floor unmet at the vessel) Tj T*
(   cutoff carries a surcharge read off the rung its shortfall reaches,) Tj T*
(   measured in whole intervals of shortfall.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(   intervals short    surcharge cents) Tj T*
(   0                  0) Tj T*
(   1                  240) Tj T*
(   3                  610) Tj T*
(   7                  1450) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(   The rung that governs is the highest rung whose interval figure is) Tj T*
(   at or below the shortfall.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3  CRANE GANG ROSTER) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(   gang        crane      shift        supervisor) Tj T*
(   gang_a      cr_1       day          supervisor_01) Tj T*
(   gang_b      cr_2       night        supervisor_02) Tj T*
(   gang_c      cr_3       relief       supervisor_03) Tj T*
(   gang_d      cr_4       day          supervisor_04) Tj T*
(   gang_e      cr_5       night        supervisor_05) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4  STANDING NOTES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(   note 001   the standing reserve of a feeder is withheld before any free capacity is counted) Tj T*
(   note 002   a crane duty reduces the capacity available to reefers and is not an extra load) Tj T*
(   note 003   the state of charge may sit on the reserve and nothing may be drawn from it there) Tj T*
(   note 004   a load equal to the capacity is lawful and is not a violation) Tj T*
(   note 005   a displaced reefer moves to the next eligible interval and not to the cheapest one) Tj T*
(   note 006   the pass budget is spent even where the shares are still moving) Tj T*
(   note 007   the ambient multiplier absent for a class pairing falls back to the class default) Tj T*
(   note 008   a peak equal to the floor of a demand band belongs to that band) Tj T*
(   note 009   fd_05 was walked at the shift handover and its cabinet read sealed) Tj T*
(   note 010   the earth bond of fd_12 was tested at the quarterly inspection) Tj T*
ET
endstream
